\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10800\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2026 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2026 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\b \uc2 TRUMP BARNSTORMS BATTLEGROUND STATES FORMER PRESIDENT RETURNS TO SCENE OF ASSASSINATION ATTEMPT FOR RALLY\b0\par\par\uc2 503 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 October 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HURRICANE MILTON INTENSIFYING\par \par \uc2 MILTON, HELENE, DAMAGE, FLOODING, POWNALL\par \par \uc2 HELENE, RECOVERY, RESPONSE, TROOPS, RESIDENTS, CRISWELL\par \par \uc2 OCT 7TH, ISRAEL \uc2 HAMAS\uc2 , GAZA, ATTACK, SIEGEL, HOSTAGES\par \par \uc2 HARRIS, CAMPAIGN, MEDIA, ABORTION, MIDDLE EAST\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 , BATTLEGROUND, RALLY, CAMPAIGN, MELANIA\par \par \uc2 REBECCA JARVIS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Okay, Mary, thank you. We turn now to Rachel Scott for the latest on former President Trump, who is hitting the battleground states, as Melania Trump explains why she's speaking out on abortion rights, as the former President looks to broaden his appeal with female voters. Good morning, Rachel.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TRUMP BARNSTORMS BATTLEGROUND STATES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FORMER PRESIDENT RETURNS TO SCENE OF ASSASSINATION ATTEMPT FOR RALLY\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Hey, Rebecca, good morning to you. In the last two weeks alone \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has had 15 campaign stops. His advisers fully aware that in an election this close, a few thousand votes in any of those battleground states could decide it all.\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  returning to Wisconsin for the fourth time in eight days, on a blitz through the battleground states that will decide this election.\par \par \uc2 FMR PRESIDENT DONALD TRUMP (UNITED STATES)\par \par \uc2 We win Wisconsin, we win the presidency.\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) In the final days, Trump delivering a dark warning, claiming without evidence, that Democrats would commit voter fraud. At one point Trump suggested that if there were any supporters of Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  in the crowd, they could get hurt.\par \par \uc2 FMR PRESIDENT DONALD TRUMP (UNITED STATES)\par \par \uc2 Is there anybody here that's going to vote for lyin Kamala? Please raise their hand. Please raise your hand. Actually, I should say don't raise your hand, it would be very dangerous. We don't want to see anybody get hurt.\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Just 24 hours earlier at a rally in Pennsylvania, the former President speaking in Butler, at the exact rally location where he narrowly dodged a would be assassin's bullet.\par \par \uc2 FMR PRESIDENT DONALD TRUMP (UNITED STATES)\par \par \uc2 We love Pennsylvania.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MELANIA TRUMP SPEAKS OUT ON ABORTION RIGHTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FORMER FIRST LADY: "I BELIEVE IN INDIVIDUAL FREEDOM"\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) With the race still neck and neck, the Trump campaign trying to make inroads with female voters. Former First Lady Melania Trump promoting her new book, now speaking out for the first time in months, splitting with her husband on abortion rights.\par \par \uc2 FMR FIRST LADY MELANIA TRUMP (UNITED STATES)\par \par \uc2 I believe in individual freedoms. I want to decide what I want to do with my body.\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Trump appointed three of the Supreme Court Justices who overturned Roe versus Wade.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHIC: TRUMP BARNSTORMS BATTLEGROUND STATES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FORMER PRESIDENT WILL MARK OCTOBER 7TH AT A FLORIDA EVENT\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Today at his golf club in Doral, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  will host Jewish leaders in a remembrance of that commemorating the October 7th attacks. Robin.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020241023eka70002y\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 FIERY EMERGENCY LANDING FRONTIER JET ENGINE CATCHES FIRE; SMOKE IN COCKPIT\b0\par\par\uc2 458 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 October 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: World News Tonight with David Muir\par \uc2 WNT\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 HURRICANE MILTON, TRACK, FLOOD, STORM SURGE, WIND\par \par \uc2 HURRICANE MILTON, EVACUATIONS, DESANTIS, GUTHRIE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: STATE OF EMERGENCY; MASS EVACUATIONS\par \par \uc2 HURRICANE HELENE, CRISWELL, TRUMP, HARRIS, RESPONSE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FALSE CLAIMS COMPLICATE HELENE RECOVERY\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL, \uc2 HAMAS\uc2 , ANNIVERSARY, HAGARI, HARRIS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WAR RAGING YEAR AFTER OCTOBER 7TH\par \par \uc2 FRONTIER AIRLINES\uc2 , ENGINE FIRE, SHOOK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FIERY EMERGENCY LANDING\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Back here in the US tonight, and to the emergency landing in Las Vegas, a \uc2 Frontier Airlines\uc2  flight with one engine on fire. The pilots declaring a midair emergency. Air traffic control unable to reach them. Here's Trevor Ault.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FRONTIER JET ENGINE CATCHES FIRE; SMOKE IN COCKPIT\par \par \uc2 TREVOR AULT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Tonight, this dramatic fiery landing in Las Vegas prompting investigations from the \uc2 NTSB\uc2  and \uc2 FAA\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 AIR TRAFFIC CONTROLLER (MALE)\par \par \uc2 They've got a fire in the right engine.\par \par \uc2 TREVOR AULT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) This \uc2 Frontier Airlines\uc2  jet from San Diego packed with 190 passengers Saturday. Pilots declaring a midair emergency as they were descending after detecting smoke in the cockpit. The crew unable to contact air traffic control.\par \par \uc2 AIR TRAFFIC CONTROLLER (MALE)\par \par \uc2 His radios are out. We have no communication with the pilot.\par \par \uc2 TREVOR AULT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) The engine in flames at touchdown. Emergency crews rushing in on the runway.\par \par \uc2 FLIGHT ATTENDANT (MALE)\par \par \uc2 Everyone, remain seated.\par \par \uc2 PASSENGER (MALE)\par \par \uc2 We just see through that through the window that we were on fire.\par \par \uc2 TREVOR AULT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) All passengers and crew using the airstairs to deplane. \uc2 Frontier\uc2  say no injuries were reported, but several passengers describing their confusion and concern upon landing.\par \par \uc2 LUCAS SHOOK (PASSENGER)\par \par \uc2 We were just in shock. We're like, you know, you see this on movies and shows, but you don't expect it to happen to you.\par \par \uc2 TREVOR AULT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) David, the airport in Las Vegas described this as a hard landing. \uc2 Frontier Airlines\uc2  says they're working to determine the cause. David?\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Trevor Ault tonight. Trevor, thanks.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GEORGIA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: 6-WEEK ABORTION BAN BACK IN EFFECT\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Tonight, to the issue of abortion rights in this country. Georgia's Supreme Court has now reinstated that state's near ban on abortion.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Last week, a Fulton County judge ruled that the law unconstitutionally deprives women control of their own bodies. It bans abortion at about six weeks. Tonight, Georgia's Supreme Court reinstating the law, pending an ongoing appeal.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) When we come back, the Patriots star arrested and charged tonight. And remembering Grammy winner Cissy Houston, Whitney Houston's mother. And tonight, we go back. Their performance together.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document WNT0000020241010eka700006\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 THE RIGHT STUFF BRA BREAKDOWN\b0\par\par\uc2 1,307 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 October 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BACK TO WORK\par \par \uc2 STRIKE, UNION, DOCKWORKERS, CONTRACT, PORTS, SUPPLY\par \par \uc2 NICHOLS, OFFICERS, CONVICTED, CRUMP, LOZIER\par \par \uc2 HELENE, AFTERMATH, MISSING, DEATHS, VOLUNTEERS, ADKINS\par \par \uc2 CAMPAIGN, CHENEY, HARRIS, RALLY, \uc2 TRUMP\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL, LEBANON, AIRSTRIKES, DEAD, DESTRUCTION\par \par \uc2 METS, COMEBACK, BREWERS, MLB\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HISTORIC HEAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 MENENDEZ, RESENTENCING, GASCON, MURDERS, EVIDENCE, GERAGOS\par \par \uc2 RESCUE, MEDICAL, CRUISE, PARKER, WEISS, AIRLIFTED\par \par \uc2 AIR TAXIS, \uc2 JOBY\uc2 , BEVIRT, UBER, GOLDSTEIN, WHITAKER\par \par \uc2 HELENE