ies. She has a brand new album called "I Am Rachel Platten." And we are breaking some big news this morning. Rachel will be heading out on tour in early 2025. So excited about that. But you can't go anywhere yet, because right now Rachel will sing live for us her song called "Mercy."\par \par \uc2 RACHEL PLATTEN PERFORMS "MERCY"\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Rachel, that was absolutely beautiful.\par \par \uc2 RACHEL PLATTEN (SINGER)\par \par \uc2 Thank you.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020241010eka10003l\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 WEATHER\b0\par\par\uc2 397 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 October 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 STRIKE, DOCKWORKERS, VELOZ, DAGGETT, RHEE, ECONOMY\par \par \uc2 HURRICANE HELENE, OWENBY, NORWOOD, CRISWELL, RAY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DESPERATE SEARCH & RESCUE MISSION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HELENE'S DEATH TOLL RISES WITH HUNDREDS STILL UNACCOUNTED FOR\par \par \uc2 STORM, TRACK, HURRICANE HELENE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW TROPICAL THREAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: POSSIBLE STORM FORMING THAT COULD HIT THE GULF COAST\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 , BIDEN, HARRIS, HURRICANE HELENE, ABORTION BAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CANDIDATES RESPOND TO HURRICANE DISASTER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HARRIS BRIEFED BY FEMA OFFICIALS; PRESIDENT BIDEN BLASTS TRUMP COMMENTS\par \par \uc2 WALZ, VANCE, DEBATE, ELECTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: COUNTDOWN TO THE VICE PRESIDENTIAL DEBATE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WHAT TO EXPECT WHEN WALZ & VANCE FACE OFF TONIGHT\par \par \uc2 HEZBOLLAH, ISRAEL, BIDEN, NETANYAHU, HAGARI\par \par \uc2 ROSE, TRIBUTE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BASEBALL GREAT PETE ROSE PASSES AWAY AT 83\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MLB'S ALL-TIME HITS LEADER WAS BANNED FOR GAMBLING ON THE GAME\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 QUEEN ELIZABETH II, 