d oh, he must be negotiating. It must be a good, strong point of negotiation. Well, it wasn't because Biden had no idea how to talk to him. He had no idea how to stop it. And now you have millions of people dead and it's only getting worse and it could lead to World War three. Don't kid yourself, David. We're playing with World War three. And we have a president that we don't even know if he's, where is our president? We don't even know if he's a president.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And, and just to clarify here...\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2  (2024 REPUBLICAN PRESIDENTIAL NOMINEE)\par \par \uc2 They threw him out of a campaign like a dog. We don't even know, is he our president? But we have a president...\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Mr. President...\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2  (2024 REPUBLICAN PRESIDENTIAL NOMINEE)\par \par \uc2 ...that doesn't know he's alive.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Your time is up. And just to clarify the question, do you believe it's in the US best interests for Ukraine to win this war? Yes or no?\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2  (2024 REPUBLICAN PRESIDENTIAL NOMINEE)\par \par \uc2 I think it's in the US best interest to get this war finished and just get it done.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right. I want...\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2  (2024 REPUBLICAN PRESIDENTIAL NOMINEE)\par \par \uc2 Negotiate a deal. Because we have to stop all of these human lives from being destroyed.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I want to take this to Vice President Harris. I want to get your thoughts on support for Ukraine in this moment. But also, as commander in chief, if elected, how would you deal with \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 , and would it be any different from what we're seeing from President Biden?\par \par \uc2 VICE PRESIDENT KAMALA HARRIS (2024 DEMOCRATIC PRESIDENTIAL NOMINEE)\par \par \uc2 Well, first of all