h the American people. But he will also make a contrast with the other candidate who is all about himself. \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 's about lifting up every American. That's what he has to tell them tonight.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Reince Priebus, what's your answer to that? What's the counter? And as \uc2 Jon Karl\uc2  was asking, which \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  shows up, a more, a more statesman-like \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  or aggressive, or is there gonna be sort of equal parts up there on that stage?\par \par \uc2 REINCE PRIEBUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You're probably gonna get equal parts. But, first of all, I think that number one, be nice. I, I think that that's something that, that, that he's got to do. Number two, focus on the issues. And number three, you know, let Biden talk. And as you saw in the segment that you just ran there, what, what this is about is not so much all the policy disputes, but what, what, what, what is \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  doing about the price of groceries? What's he doing about the price of gas, insurance, plane tickets?\par \par \uc2 REINCE PRIEBUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That's what those people want to know. They want to know how \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  or \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is going to make their lives easier instead of living paycheck, paycheck to paycheck. So, that's what this is about. And the more it's on the issues, the better it's going to be for \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . And I think that's where his focus is going to be.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right. Reince Priebus, Donna Brazile, stick with us here. We're gonna be coming back to you all night long. Thank you for that. When we come back here, as you heard Reince mention, the economy, inflation. Also tonight, abortion rights at the leading of the Supreme Court. Of course, immigration. We're going to go live to the border. President Biden, of course, taking action in recent weeks on the border. The question,